{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：尤其 S08–S12 这些短停留段，Y的话与感受切换较密，部分感受提示连续出现，实际扫读不如X左右分栏来得顺。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更容易让人抓住每一阶段真正的心理转折，【】突出关键意思，话与感受交替也让音乐细节和人物心境建立了更直接的联系。尤其是从怀念被当作自己人、怀疑离开的决定，到承认过去确实美好但不愿重新忍受委屈，Y把矛盾的两面及其变化交代得更细，前后也有更明确的呼应。X的优势是版面分区清楚、整体叙述连贯，短时间扫读更轻松，但音乐感受的具体变化和情绪层次有所损失。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f2b32a86-267d-4e45-942c-4a45e795f586", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T001106245032Z", "elapsed_seconds": 60.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:12:06.882156+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "43ce2391e6825c271a550f943c5790802370c2173348b6d6c20ac76511ebf8cd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3